      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Code Generation**\n\nI'm starting by building `embed_text.py` with the Google embeddings API; this is the cornerstone for the project. Subsequently, I'll proceed with creating the remaining nine Python files, each designed to interface with a separate external provider for scored content, each using the `write` tool. I aim to ensure each provider is distinct.\n\n\n**Developing Core Functionality**\n\nI've begun building the core functionality with `embed_text.py`, utilizing Google's Vertex AI Embeddings. I'm focusing on getting this right before moving to the other modules. I'm planning to implement helper files `embeddings_client.py` and `embeddings_models.py` after I complete `embed_text.py`. The other files will be for interfacing with content providers.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789843882565,
          "start": 1789843880230
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb0239260014HJQDIKi99xjfZ",
