      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Local Helpers**\n\nI'm now focusing on creating the local helper files, `embeddings_client.py` and `embeddings_models.py`. The first will contain client-side utilities, particularly setup for Google Cloud Vertex AI. The second, `embeddings_models.py`, is where I will define the request and response normalization processes.\n\n\n**Creating Client Helpers**\n\nI've been working on the implementation of `embeddings_client.py` and `embeddings_models.py`. The first will indeed focus on client-side utilities, particularly the setup for Google Cloud Vertex AI. The second, `embeddings_models.py`, will be used to define helpers for request and response normalization.\n\n\n",
