      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Embeddings Helpers**\n\nI'm now focusing on `embeddings_models.py`. The plan is to establish request, response, and normalization functions locally. A straightforward utility to format instances for Vertex AI API integration will also be included in this file.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789843887563,
