      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Embeddings**\n\nI'm currently focused on implementing `embed_batch.py`. This crucial script will generate embeddings for a batch of texts. I'm leveraging the capabilities of `embeddings_client.py` and `embeddings_models.py` as helper functions to accomplish this.\n\n\n",
