        "text": "**Implementing Semantic Search**\n\nI'm currently focused on implementing `embed_for_search.py` to handle query and document embeddings for semantic search. I plan to leverage the existing `embeddings_client.py` and `embeddings_models.py` modules to accomplish this.\n\n\n",
