        "text": "**Implementing Job Summary**\n\nI'm now implementing the \"Later-step scored files\" functionality. I've started with `embedding_job_summary.py`, which will summarize embedding job results. I'm simulating logging job summaries using Google Cloud Logging. This approach will allow us to record the details of the embedding jobs, specifically the embeddings and their associated text. This is a critical first step.\n\n\n**Developing Embedding Summaries**\n\nI'm focusing on \"Later-step scored files\" now, beginning with `embedding_job_summary.py`. I'm summarizing embedding job results, assuming an embedding job has a list of embeddings and texts. I'll simulate logging summaries using Google Cloud Logging. This step focuses on the integration with Google.\n\n\n",
